  <data name="Help" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>5250net, an IBM i console terminal.
Usage: 5250net HOST [options]
  --port NUMBER       Default 23, or 992 with TLS.
  --tls               Use direct TLS with certificate validation.
  --tls-certificate FILE  Trust a PEM or DER CA or self-signed server certificate.
  --tls-trust-all     Skip server certificate and hostname validation.
  --device NAME       Request an IBM i display device (up to 10 characters).
  --code-page NUMBER  EBCDIC code page, default 37.
  --keyboard TYPE     IBM keyboard type, default USB.
  --wide              Advertise a 27 by 132 color display.
  --capture-directory PATH  Save changed host screens as standalone HTML pages.
  --help              Show this help.
  --version           Show the version.
Keys: Enter, F1 through F12, Shift+F1 through Shift+F12 for F13 through F24.
Tab and Shift+Tab select fields. Home selects the start of the field.
Ctrl+Enter sends Field Exit. Keypad plus and minus send Field+ and Field-.
End selects the end of its content. Insert toggles insert mode.
Delete and Backspace edit. Ctrl+End erases to the end of the field.
PageUp and PageDown send Roll keys. Alt+H sends Help.
Ctrl+A sends Attention. Ctrl+S sends System Request.
Escape resets an input error. Ctrl+Q disconnects.
</value>
  </data>
